#sortorder:5
#showas:难度 6 - 双 AI + 掠夺者
A bit more complicated. It's mostly just you and two AIs, and it's set to difficulty 6.  Most players will only want to try this if you're experienced with some of the previous starts. All the same tricks from before, but two AIs now, so it's more dangerous when doing them.

This is on the "realistic" map type, with 80 planets. Simple Ensemble AI type in both cases.  Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Just like before, you have Human Resistance Fighters to help out. But in addition, there's another faction that adds a little chaos in the form of Marauders; human pirates that will also occasionally appear just like the Resistance Fighters, but they attack everyone with the goal of capturing the planet to use as a base to strengthen themselves. 

Marauders can be fairly nasty if you like to have backline planets.  They've been set to a lower than default intensity here, so they're not too powerful, just so you can get used to them here without much bother, as they can be a major actor in the galaxy if left alone.